#: source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:4
msgid "Training a Gear Insertion Policy and ROS Deployment"
msgstr "训练齿轮插入策略和 ROS 部署"

#: source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:6
msgid ""
"This tutorial walks you through how to train a gear insertion reinforcement "
"learning (RL) policy that transfers from simulation to a real robot. The "
"workflow consists of two main stages:"
msgstr "本教程介绍如何训练可从仿真迁移到真实机器人的齿轮插入装配强化学习（RL）策略。工作流分为两个主要阶段："

#: source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:8
msgid ""
"**Simulation Training in Isaac Lab**: Train the policy in a high-fidelity "
"physics simulation with domain randomization"
msgstr "**在 Isaac Lab 中进行仿真训练**: 在具有域随机化的高保真物理仿真中训练策略"

#: source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:9
msgid ""
"**Real Robot Deployment with Isaac ROS**: Deploy the trained policy on real "
"hardware using Isaac ROS and a custom ROS inference node"
msgstr "**使用 Isaac ROS 进行真实机器人部署**: 使用 Isaac ROS 和自定义 ROS 推理节点将训练好的策略部署到真实硬件上"

#: source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:11
msgid ""
"This walkthrough covers the key principles and best practices for sim-to-"
"real transfer using Isaac Lab."
msgstr "本教程介绍使用 Isaac Lab 完成仿真到现实迁移的关键原则与实践方法。"

#: source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:13
msgid "**Supported Robots:**"
msgstr "**支持的机器人：**"

#: source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:15
msgid ""
"**Universal Robots UR10e**: 6-DOF industrial robot arm with Robotiq 2F-140 "
"or 2F-85 gripper"
msgstr "**Universal Robots UR10e** ：6 自由度工业机械臂，配备 Robotiq 2F-140 或 2F-85 夹爪"

#: source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:16
msgid ""
"**Flexiv Rizon 4s**: 7-DOF collaborative robot arm with Grav parallel "
"gripper"
msgstr "**Flexiv Rizon 4s** ：7 自由度协作机械臂，配备 Grav 平行夹爪"

#: source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:18
msgid "**Task Details:**"
msgstr "**任务详情:**"

#: source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:20
msgid "The gear assembly policy operates as follows:"
msgstr "齿轮装配策略的工作方式如下: "

#: source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:22
msgid ""
"**Initial State**: The policy assumes the gear is already grasped by the "
"gripper at the start of the episode"
msgstr "**初始状态**: 策略假设在回合开始时齿轮已被夹爪抓取"

#: source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:23
msgid ""
"**Input Observations**: The policy receives the pose of the gear shaft "
"(position and orientation) in which the gear should be inserted, obtained "
"from a separate perception pipeline"
msgstr "**输入观测**: 策略接收齿轮轴的位姿（位置和方向），即齿轮应该插入的位置，该信息来自单独的感知管线"

#: source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:24
msgid ""
"**Policy Output**: The policy outputs delta joint positions (incremental "
"changes to joint angles) to control the robot arm and perform the insertion"
msgstr "**策略输出**: 策略输出增量关节位置（关节角度的增量变化）来控制机械臂并执行插入操作"

#: source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:25
msgid ""
"**Generalization**: The trained policy generalizes across 3 different gear "
"sizes without requiring retraining for each size"
msgstr "**泛化能力**: 训练好的策略可以泛化到 3 种不同尺寸的齿轮，无需针对每种尺寸重新训练"

#: source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:28
msgid "Comparison of gear assembly in simulation versus real hardware"
msgstr "仿真与真实硬件中齿轮装配的对比"

#: source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:33
msgid ""
"Sim-to-real transfer: Gear assembly policy trained in Isaac Lab (left) "
"successfully deployed on real UR10e robot (right)."
msgstr "仿真到真实迁移: 在 Isaac Lab 中训练的齿轮装配策略（左）成功部署到真实 UR10e 机器人（右）。"

#: source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:35
msgid ""
"This environment has been successfully deployed on real UR10e and Flexiv "
"Rizon 4s robots without an IsaacLab dependency."
msgstr "该环境已成功部署到真实的 UR10e 和 Flexiv Rizon 4s 机器人上，部署时不依赖 Isaac Lab。"

#: source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:37
msgid "**Scope of This Tutorial:**"
msgstr "**本教程的范围：**"

#: source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:39
msgid ""
"This tutorial focuses exclusively on the **training part** of the sim-to-"
"real transfer workflow in Isaac Lab. For the complete deployment workflow on"
" the real robot, including the exact steps to set up the vision pipeline, "
"robot interface and the ROS inference node to run your trained policy on "
"real hardware, please refer to the `Isaac ROS Documentation <https://nvidia-"
"isaac-"
"ros.github.io/v/release-4.6/reference_workflows/isaac_for_manipulation/packages/isaac_ros_manipulation_dnn_policy/index.html>`_."
msgstr ""
"本教程仅介绍 Isaac Lab 仿真到现实迁移工作流的 **训练部分** "
"。真实机器人的完整部署流程，包括视觉流水线、机器人接口，以及在硬件上运行已训练策略的 ROS 推理节点配置步骤，见 `Isaac ROS 文档 "
"<https://nvidia-isaac-"
"ros.github.io/v/release-4.6/reference_workflows/isaac_for_manipulation/packages/isaac_ros_manipulation_dnn_policy/index.html>`_"
" 。"

#: source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:42
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:44
msgid ""
"Successful sim-to-real transfer requires addressing three fundamental "
"aspects:"
msgstr "成功的仿真到真实迁移需要解决三个基本方面:"

#: source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:46
msgid ""
"**Input Consistency**: Ensuring the observations your policy receives in "
"simulation match those available on the real robot"
msgstr "**输入一致性**: 确保策略在仿真中接收的观测与真实机器人上可用的观测相匹配"

#: source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:47
msgid ""
"**System Response Consistency**: Ensuring the robot and environment respond "
"to actions in simulation the same way they do in reality"
msgstr "**系统响应一致性**: 确保机器人和环境在仿真中对动作的响应与在现实中相同"

#: source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:48
msgid ""
"**Output Consistency**: Ensuring any post-processing applied to policy "
"outputs in Isaac Lab is also applied during real-world inference"
msgstr "**输出一致性**: 确保在 Isaac Lab 中应用于策略输出的任何后处理也应用于真实世界推理"

#: source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:50
msgid ""
"When all three aspects are properly addressed, policies trained purely in "
"simulation can achieve robust performance on real hardware without any real-"
"world training data."
msgstr "当这三个方面都得到妥善解决时，纯粹在仿真中训练的策略可以在真实硬件上实现稳健的性能，而无需任何真实世界的训练数据。"

#: source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:52
msgid ""
"**Debugging Tip**: When your policy fails on the real robot, the best "
"approach to debug is to set up the real robot with the same initial "
"observations as in simulation, then compare how the controller/system "
"respond. This isolates whether the problem is from observation mismatch "
"(Input Consistency) or physics/controller mismatch (System Response "
"Consistency)."
msgstr ""
"**调试技巧**: "
"当策略在真实机器人上失败时，最好的调试方法是将真实机器人设置为与仿真中相同的初始观测，然后比较控制器/系统的响应方式。这可以隔离问题是来自观测不匹配（输入一致性）还是物理/控制器不匹配（系统响应一致性）。"

