#: source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:352
msgid ""
"For the UR10e and Flexiv Rizon 4s deployments, we use an impedance "
"controller interface. Using a simpler controller like impedance control "
"reduces the chances of variation between simulation and reality compared to "
"more complex controllers (e.g., operational space control, hybrid force-"
"position control). Simpler controllers:"
msgstr ""
"部署到 UR10e 和 Flexiv Rizon 4s "
"时，我们使用阻抗控制器接口。相较于操作空间控制、混合力位控制等更复杂的控制器，阻抗控制这类较简单的控制器可以降低仿真与现实之间出现差异的可能性。较简单的控制器具有以下特点："

#: source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:354
msgid "Have fewer parameters that can mismatch between sim and real"
msgstr "仿真和真实之间可能不匹配的参数更少"

#: source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:355
msgid "Are easier to model accurately in simulation"
msgstr "在仿真中更容易准确建模"

#: source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:356
msgid "Have more predictable behavior that's easier to replicate"
msgstr "具有更可预测的行为，更容易复制"

#: source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:357
msgid "Reduce the controller complexity as a source of sim-real gap"
msgstr "减少控制器复杂性作为仿真-真实差距的来源"

#: source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:359
