#: source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:748
msgid ""
"In the early stages of training, you should see the robots moving around "
"with the gears grasped by the grippers, but they won't be successfully "
"inserting the gears yet. This is expected behavior as the policy is still "
"learning. The robots will move the grasped gear in various directions. Once "
"you've verified the environment looks correct, stop the training (Ctrl+C) "
"and proceed to full-scale training."
msgstr ""
"在训练的早期阶段，您应该看到机器人在移动，夹爪抓着齿轮，但它们还不能成功插入齿轮。这是预期的行为，因为策略仍在学习中。机器人会将抓取的齿轮向各个方向移动。一旦您验证环境看起来正确，停止训练（Ctrl+C）并继续进行全规模训练。"

#: source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:751
msgid "Step 2: Full-Scale Training with Video Recording"
msgstr "步骤 2: 带视频录制的全规模训练"

#: source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:753
msgid ""
"Now launch the full training run with more parallel environments in headless"
" mode for faster training. We'll also enable video recording to monitor "
"progress:"
msgstr "现在在无头模式下启动更多并行环境的完整训练以加快训练速度。我们还将启用视频录制来监控进度:"

#: source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:823
msgid "**Command breakdown:**"
msgstr "**命令说明：**"

#: source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:825
msgid ""
"``--num_envs 256``: Runs 256 parallel environments for efficient training"
msgstr "``--num_envs 256`` ：运行 256 个并行环境，提高训练效率。"

#: source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:826
msgid ""
"``--video_length 200``: Each video captures approximately one full episode "
"(``episode_length_s / (sim.dt * decimation)`` = ``6.66 / (1/1000 * 33)`` ≈ "
"200 steps)"
msgstr ""
"``--video_length 200`` ：每段视频大致覆盖一个完整回合（ ``episode_length_s / (sim.dt * "
"decimation)`` = ``6.66 / (1/1000 * 33)`` ≈ 200 步）。"

#: source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:827
msgid ""
"``--video_interval 76800``: Records a video every 76,800 environment steps "
"(~every 150 iterations), producing ~10 videos over full training"
msgstr ""
"``--video_interval 76800`` ：每 76,800 个环境步（约每 150 次迭代）录制一段视频，完整训练期间约生成 10 "
"段视频。"

#: source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:829
msgid ""
"Training typically takes ~12-24 hours for a robust insertion policy. The "
"videos will be saved in the ``logs`` directory and can be reviewed to assess"
" policy performance during training."
msgstr "训练一个稳健的插入策略通常需要约 12-24 小时。视频将保存在 ``logs`` 目录中，可以查看以评估训练期间的策略性能。"

#: source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:833
msgid ""
"**GPU Memory Considerations**: The default configuration uses 256 parallel "
"environments, which should work on most modern GPUs (e.g., RTX 3090, RTX "
"4090, A100). For better sim-to-real transfer performance, you can increase "
"``solver_position_iteration_count`` from 4 to 196 in "
"``gear_assembly_env_cfg.py`` and ``joint_pos_env_cfg.py`` for more realistic"
" contact simulation, but this requires a larger GPU (e.g., RTX PRO 6000 with"
" 40GB+ VRAM). Higher solver iteration counts reduce penetration and improve "
"contact stability but significantly increase GPU memory usage."
msgstr ""
"**GPU 内存注意事项**: 默认配置使用 256 个并行环境，这应该适用于大多数现代 GPU（例如 RTX 3090、RTX "
"4090、A100）。为了获得更好的仿真到真实迁移性能，您可以在 ``gear_assembly_env_cfg.py`` 和 "
"``joint_pos_env_cfg.py`` 中将 ``solver_position_iteration_count`` 从 4 增加到 196 "
"以获得更真实的接触仿真，但这需要更大的 GPU（例如具有 40GB+ VRAM 的 RTX PRO "
"6000）。更高的求解器迭代次数可以减少穿透并提高接触稳定性，但会显著增加 GPU 内存使用量。"

#: source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:836
msgid "**Monitoring Training Progress with TensorBoard:**"
msgstr "**使用 TensorBoard 监控训练进度:**"

#: source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:838
msgid ""
"You can monitor training metrics in real-time using TensorBoard. Open a new "
"terminal and run:"
msgstr "您可以使用 TensorBoard 实时监控训练指标。打开一个新终端并运行: "

#: source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:874
msgid ""
"Replace the log directory path with your actual training log location if "
"different. TensorBoard will display plots showing rewards, episode lengths, "
"and other metrics. Verify that the rewards are increasing over iterations to"
" ensure the policy is learning successfully."
msgstr ""
"如果训练日志位置不同，请将日志目录路径改为实际位置。TensorBoard "
"会显示奖励、回合长度及其他指标曲线。请确认奖励随迭代增加，以判断策略是否在有效学习。"

#: source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:878
msgid "Step 3: Deploy on Real Robot"
msgstr "步骤 3: 部署到真实机器人"

#: source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:880
msgid ""
"Once training is complete, follow the `Isaac ROS inference documentation "
"<https://nvidia-isaac-"
"ros.github.io/v/release-4.6/reference_workflows/isaac_for_manipulation/packages/isaac_ros_manipulation_dnn_policy/index.html>`_"
" to deploy your policy."
msgstr ""
"训练完成后，按照 `Isaac ROS 推理文档 <https://nvidia-isaac-"
"ros.github.io/v/release-4.6/reference_workflows/isaac_for_manipulation/packages/isaac_ros_manipulation_dnn_policy/index.html>`_"
" 部署策略。"

#: source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:882
msgid ""
"The Isaac ROS deployment pipeline directly uses the trained model checkpoint"
" (``.pt`` file) along with the ``agent.yaml`` and ``env.yaml`` configuration"
" files generated during training. No additional export step is required."
msgstr ""
"Isaac ROS 部署管线直接使用训练好的模型检查点（ ``.pt`` 文件）以及训练期间生成的 ``agent.yaml`` 和 "
"``env.yaml`` 配置文件。无需额外的导出步骤。"

#: source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:884
msgid ""
"The deployment pipeline uses Isaac ROS and a custom ROS inference node to "
"run the policy on real hardware. The pipeline includes:"
msgstr "部署管线使用 Isaac ROS 和自定义 ROS 推理节点在真实硬件上运行策略。管线包括: "

#: source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:886
msgid ""
"**Perception**: Camera-based pose estimation (FoundationPose, Segment "
"Anything)"
msgstr "**感知**: 基于相机的位姿估计（FoundationPose、Segment Anything）"

#: source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:887
msgid "**Motion Planning**: cuMotion for collision-free trajectories"
msgstr "**运动规划**: cuMotion 用于无碰撞轨迹"

#: source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:888
msgid ""
"**Policy Inference**: Your trained policy running at control frequency in a "
"custom ROS inference node"
msgstr "**策略推理**: 您训练好的策略在自定义 ROS 推理节点中以控制频率运行"

#: source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:889
msgid "**Robot Control**: Low-level controller executing commands"
msgstr "**机器人控制**: 执行命令的底层控制器"

#: source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:893
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "故障排除"

#: source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:895
msgid ""
"This section covers common errors you may encounter during training and "
"their solutions."
msgstr "本节介绍您在训练期间可能遇到的常见错误及其解决方案。"

#: source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:898
msgid "PhysX Collision Stack Overflow"
msgstr "PhysX 碰撞堆栈溢出"

#: source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:900
#: source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:928
msgid "**Error Message:**"
msgstr "**错误消息:**"

#: source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:908
msgid ""
"**Cause:** This error occurs when the GPU collision detection buffer is too "
"small for the number of contacts being simulated. This is common in contact-"
"rich environments like gear assembly."
msgstr "**原因:** 当 GPU 碰撞检测缓冲区对于正在仿真的接触数量来说太小时，会发生此错误。这在齿轮装配等接触密集型环境中很常见。"

#: source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:910
msgid ""
"**Solution:** Increase the ``gpu_collision_stack_size`` parameter in "
"``gear_assembly_env_cfg.py``:"
msgstr ""
"**解决方案:** 在 ``gear_assembly_env_cfg.py`` 中增加 ``gpu_collision_stack_size`` "
"参数: "

#: source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:923
msgid ""
"The error message will suggest a minimum size. Set "
"``gpu_collision_stack_size`` to at least the recommended value (e.g., if the"
" error says \"at least 269452544\", set it to ``2**28`` or ``2**29``). Note "
"that increasing this value increases GPU memory usage."
msgstr ""
"错误消息会建议最小大小。将 ``gpu_collision_stack_size`` 设置为至少推荐的值（例如，如果错误提示 \"至少 "
"269452544\" ，则将其设置为 ``2**28`` 或 ``2**29`` ）。请注意，增加此值会增加 GPU 内存使用量。"

#: source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:926
msgid "CUDA Out of Memory"
msgstr "CUDA 内存不足"

#: source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:934
msgid ""
"**Cause:** The GPU does not have enough memory to run the requested number "
"of parallel environments with the current simulation parameters."
msgstr "**原因：** 在当前仿真参数下，GPU 显存不足以运行指定数量的并行环境。"

#: source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:936
msgid "**Solutions (in order of preference):**"
msgstr "**解决方案（按优先顺序）:**"

#: source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:938
msgid "**Reduce the number of parallel environments:**"
msgstr "**减少并行环境数量:**"

#: source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:958
msgid ""
"**Trade-off:** Using fewer environments will reduce sample diversity per "
"training iteration and may slow down training convergence. You may need to "
"train for more iterations to achieve the same performance. However, the "
"final policy quality should be similar."
msgstr ""
"**权衡:** "
"使用更少的环境会减少每次训练迭代的样本多样性，可能会减慢训练收敛速度。您可能需要训练更多迭代才能达到相同的性能。但是，最终的策略质量应该相似。"

#: source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:960
msgid ""
"**If using increased solver iteration counts** (values higher than the "
"default 4):"
msgstr "**如果增大了求解器迭代次数** （高于默认值 4）："

#: source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:962
msgid ""
"In both ``gear_assembly_env_cfg.py`` and ``joint_pos_env_cfg.py``, reduce "
"``solver_position_iteration_count`` back to the default value of 4, or use "
"intermediate values like 8 or 16:"
msgstr ""
"在 ``gear_assembly_env_cfg.py`` 和 ``joint_pos_env_cfg.py`` 中，将 "
"``solver_position_iteration_count`` 减少回默认值 4，或使用中间值如 8 或 16:"

#: source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:976
msgid ""
"**Trade-off:** Lower solver iteration counts may result in less realistic "
"contact dynamics and more penetration issues. The default value of 4 "
"provides a good balance for most use cases."
msgstr "**权衡:** 较低的求解器迭代次数可能导致接触动力学不太真实且穿透问题更多。默认值 4 为大多数用例提供了良好的平衡。"

#: source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:978
msgid "**Disable video recording during training:**"
msgstr "**在训练期间禁用视频录制:**"

#: source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:980
msgid "Remove the ``--video`` flags to save GPU memory:"
msgstr "移除 ``--video`` 标志以节省 GPU 内存:"

#: source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:1000
msgid "You can always evaluate the trained policy later with visualization."
msgstr "您可以随时使用可视化评估训练好的策略。"

#: source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:1004
msgid "Deterministic Debugging (Play Environment)"
msgstr "确定性调试（回放环境）"

#: source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:1006
msgid ""
"Playing the ``IsaacContrib-Deploy-GearAssembly-Rizon4s-Grav-ROS-Inference`` "
"environment provides a fully deterministic setup for debugging policy "
"behavior against a specific real-world scenario. The ``play_mode`` method of"
" ``Rizon4sGearAssemblyROSInferenceEnvCfg`` is applied automatically by the "
"play command: all randomization is disabled and observation noise is turned "
"off, so the simulation is identical on every reset."
msgstr ""
"回放 ``IsaacContrib-Deploy-GearAssembly-Rizon4s-Grav-ROS-Inference`` "
"环境可提供完全确定性的设置，用于针对特定实机场景调试策略行为。回放命令会自动应用 "
"``Rizon4sGearAssemblyROSInferenceEnvCfg`` 的 ``play_mode`` "
"方法，关闭所有随机化和观测噪声，因此每次重置后的仿真状态都相同。"

#: source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:1013
msgid "To use it, run the standard play command:"
msgstr "使用时运行标准回放命令："

#: source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:1035
msgid ""
"To match a specific real-world setup, edit the play-mode constants at the "
"top of the ``Rizon4sGearAssemblyROSInferenceEnvCfg`` class in "
"``isaaclab_tasks/.../gear_assembly/config/rizon_4s/ros_inference_env_cfg.py``:"
msgstr ""
"要匹配特定的实机设置，请编辑 "
"``isaaclab_tasks/.../gear_assembly/config/rizon_4s/ros_inference_env_cfg.py``"
" 中 ``Rizon4sGearAssemblyROSInferenceEnvCfg`` 类顶部的回放模式常量："

#: source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:1053
msgid ""
"When ``OBS_SHAFT_POS`` or ``OBS_SHAFT_QUAT`` are set (not ``None``), the "
"play command automatically overwrites the corresponding portions of the "
"policy's observation tensor every step, regardless of simulation state.  "
"This lets you test what the policy does when given a specific observation "
"(e.g. a pose captured from the real robot)."
msgstr ""
"当 ``OBS_SHAFT_POS`` 或 ``OBS_SHAFT_QUAT`` 已设置（非 ``None`` "
"）时，回放命令会在每一步自动覆盖策略观测张量中的对应部分，不受仿真状态影响。这样可以测试策略接收到特定观测（例如从实机获取的位姿）时会如何行动。"

